From: richie-rich90454 <rjiang880@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH 0007/0014] Remove remote extensions

This patch removes Remote-SSH, Remote-Containers, Remote-WSL, and
Remote-Tunnels.

Rationale: the entire IDE is remote already. The browser connects to a
server on the workspace VM, so there is no local-vs-remote distinction.

Diff: authored on the upstream checkout (see build.sh).
Verification: patch regression test fails without it and passes with it.
